/**
 * Cozy Cleanup — room level data. Collection 1, "Cozy Home" (levels 1-10),
 * fully handcrafted: every room has an intentional layout, a specific mess,
 * and a specific set of cleaning/organizing tasks built from the shared
 * engine (CleaningCanvas, GlassSurface, DraggableItem, BedMaker, ClothFold).
 * Nothing here is generated by shuffling coordinates — each room reuses the
 * same *systems* but was laid out on purpose (see FurnitureKit.jsx for the
 * shared illustrated pieces every room composes from).
 *
 * All coordinates are percentages of the room stage's own box, so the scene
 * scales losslessly with the GamePlayer stage at any desktop size.
 *
 * Collections 2-5 (levels 11-50: Dream Apartment, Sweet Café, Boutique
 * Hotel, Luxury House) are not authored yet — see data/collections.js and
 * the final report for how to extend this file with them using the exact
 * same schema.
 */

